291,'_block_1_slides_1_text','field_689f213c9721a'),(5431,291,'block_1_slides_1_button_text','Читать'),(5432,291,'_block_1_slides_1_button_text','field_689f213c9721b'),(5433,291,'block_1_slides_1_button_link','/skolzkij-led-margarita-drobyazko/'),(5434,291,'_block_1_slides_1_button_link','field_689f213c9721c'),(5435,291,'block_1_slides_0_ikonka','226'),(5436,291,'_block_1_slides_0_ikonka','field_689f2214acff3'),(5437,291,'block_1_slides_1_ikonka','227'),(5438,291,'_block_1_slides_1_ikonka','field_689f2214acff3'),(5439,291,'video_ikonka','228'),(5440,291,'_video_ikonka','field_689f2239c4939'),(5441,291,'block_2_items_0_icon_desktop',''),(5442,291,'_block_2_items_0_icon_desktop','field_65d3b1a2a9b6r'),(5443,291,'block_2_items_0_icon_mobile',''),(5444,291,'_block_2_items_0_icon_mobile','field_65d3b1a2a9b7s'),(5445,291,'block_2_items_0_text','144 пациента \r\n<br> приняли участие'),(5446,291,'_block_2_items_0_text','field_65d3b1a2a9b8t'),(5447,291,'block_2_items_0_ikonka','231'),(5448,291,'_block_2_items_0_ikonka','field_65d3b1a2a9b6r'),(5449,291,'block_2_items_1_ikonka','232'),(5450,291,'_block_2_items_1_ikonka','field_65d3b1a2a9b6r'),(5451,291,'block_2_items_1_text','пациенты в возрасте \r\n<br> \r\nот 18 до 55 лет'),(5452,291,'_block_2_items_1_text','field_65d3b1a2a9b8t'),(5453,291,'block_2_items_2_ikonka','233'),(5454,291,'_block_2_items_2_ikonka','field_65d3b1a2a9b6r'),(5455,291,'block_2_items_2_text','пациенты с тревожными расстройствами \r\n<br> \r\nпосле перенесенного COVID-19'),(5456,291,'_block_2_items_2_text','field_65d3b1a2a9b8t'),(5457,291,'block_3_left_cards_0_title','Нарастающее <br>действие'),(5458,291,'_block_3_left_cards_0_title','field_65d3b1a2aac4z'),(5459,291,'block_3_left_cards_0_icon','241'),(5460,291,'_block_3_left_cards_0_icon','field_65d3b1a2aac5a'),(5461,291,'block_3_left_cards_0_text','<span>Улучшение</span> состояния наблюдалось уже \r\n<span>через 2 недели</span> \r\nи усиливалось к 8-й неделе \r\n<span>(снижение тревоги по шкале HARS на 8,